---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const articleSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Article",
  "headline": "Nande-Mahalunge-Maan Real Estate Guide 2026: Tri-Corridor Growth",
  "description": "Comprehensive guide to the Nande-Mahalunge-Maan real estate growth belt. PMRDA Town Planning Scheme 1, Pune Inner Ring Road, and Hinjewadi IT access.",
  "author": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "PMRDA Infrastructure & Urban Research"
  },
  "publisher": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Propsmart Realty Max"
  },
  "datePublished": "2026-02-15",
  "dateModified": "2026-09-21"
};
---

<Layout
  title="Nande-Mahalunge-Maan Real Estate Guide | PMRDA Scheme & IT Corridor"
  description="Explore the Nande-Mahalunge-Maan growth corridor in West Pune. PMRDA Town Planning Scheme 1, 36m DP roads, river bridges, and Mahindra 13.46-acre development."
  keywords="nande mahalunge maan real estate, nande mahalunge corridor, pmrda town planning scheme nande mahalunge, flats in nande, flats in mahalunge, flats in maan"
  canonical="https://mahindralifespaceshomes.in/articles/nande-mahalunge-maan-real-estate-guide/"
  customSchema={articleSchema}
>
  <article class="pt-32 pb-24 bg-charcoal-950 text-stone-300">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-10">
      
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="space-y-4 border-b border-white/10 pb-8">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 text-xs text-gold-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold">
          <a href="/articles/" class="hover:underline">← All Research</a>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>Corridor Master Plan</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>Updated September 2026</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-stone-100 leading-tight">
          Nande–Mahalunge–Maan Real Estate Guide: PMRDA Town Planning, Inner Ring Road & IT Corridor Hubs
        </h1>

        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-stone-400 font-light leading-relaxed">
          The three adjoining micro-markets of Nande, Mahalunge, and Maan form West Pune’s most strategic urban growth triangle. Here is how planned civic infrastructure and blue-chip developer investments are shaping its future.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature Image -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 shadow-2xl">
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534438327276-14e5300c3a48?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85"
          alt="Nande Mahalunge Maan Real Estate Landscape"
          class="w-full h-80 sm:h-96 object-cover"
        />
        <div class="p-3 bg-charcoal-900 text-[11px] text-stone-400 text-center">
          The Nande-Mahalunge-Maan growth triangle: Riverfront topography adjoining Hinjewadi Phase 1, 2, and 3.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Key Insights -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-gold-500/30 space-y-3">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-base text-gold-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">The Tri-Corridor at a Glance</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-300">
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
            <span class="text-gold-400">✔</span>
            <span><strong>Mahalunge:</strong> The high-tech transit core; directly connects to Hinjewadi Phase 1 via the proposed river bridge and Balewadi High Street via 36m DP road.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
            <span class="text-gold-400">✔</span>
            <span><strong>Nande:</strong> The green bio-reserve residential haven; scenic valley topography, low vehicle density, and host to Mahindra Lifespaces’ 13.46-acre acquisition.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
            <span class="text-gold-400">✔</span>
            <span><strong>Maan:</strong> The western employment anchor; directly abuts Hinjewadi Phase 3 and TCS Sahyadri Park with proposed metro terminal access.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Article Content -->
      <div class="space-y-8 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-300">
        
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-stone-100 font-bold">1. PMRDA Town Planning Scheme 1 (Mahalunge-Maan)</h2>
        <p>
          The Pune Metropolitan Region Development Authority (PMRDA) selected Mahalunge and Maan for its first flagship Town Planning Scheme. Spanning approximately 250 hectares, the scheme represents an institutional departure from piecemeal real estate development:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc pl-5">
          <li><strong>36-Meter Arterial Ring Roads:</strong> Multi-lane divided boulevards ensuring traffic fluidity for the next 40+ years.</li>
          <li><strong>Underground Utility Ducting:</strong> Water, electricity, telecom, and optical fiber are routed in subterranean utility tunnels, preventing road digging.</li>
          <li><strong>Civic Reservations:</strong> Dedicated plots allocated for international schools, tertiary healthcare centers, landscaped parks, and sports complexes.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-stone-100 font-bold">2. The Mahalunge-Hinjewadi Riverfront Bridge Bypass</h2>
        <p>
          Currently, travelers from Baner or Balewadi heading to Hinjewadi must navigate the congested NH-48 Wakad flyover and Shivaji Chowk bottleneck. The upcoming Mahalunge-Hinjewadi bridge across the Mula river creates a direct bypass route, slashing travel times to Infosys and Wipro gates down to 7 minutes.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-stone-100 font-bold">3. Mahindra Lifespaces’ Role in the Corridor</h2>
        <p>
          In October 2025, Mahindra Lifespaces announced its strategic acquisition of 13.46 acres in this corridor with an estimated development potential of ₹3,500 Crore. As an institutional master community, it will establish the gold standard for sustainable biophilic architecture, water conservation, and residential livability in the Nande-Mahalunge belt.
        </p>

        <!-- CTA Box -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-gold-500/40 text-center space-y-4">
          <h3 class="font-serif text-lg text-white font-bold">
            Explore the Nande-Mahalunge Corridor Dossiers
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 max-w-lg mx-auto">
            Review detailed micro-market pricing, floor plan projections, and pre-launch EOI registration details.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
            <a
              href="/west-pune/mahalunge-real-estate/"
              class="px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-gold-400 text-charcoal-950 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs shadow-md hover:bg-gold-300 transition-all"
            >
              Mahalunge Dossier
            </a>
            <a
              href="/west-pune/nande-real-estate/"
              class="px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full border border-white/20 text-stone-200 hover:text-white font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs transition-all"
            >
              Nande Dossier
            </a>
            <a
              href="/west-pune/maan-real-estate/"
              class="px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full border border-white/20 text-stone-200 hover:text-white font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs transition-all"
            >
              Maan Dossier
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
